ors number it. Its links to the Lean were made with AI for Proof Reader and have not been reviewed by the authors.","citation_ids":["cite.euler.lemma-d.1"],"evidence_ids":["link.euler.lemma-d.1"],"id":"euler.lemma-d.1","kind":"claim","label":"Lemma D.1","locator":"Lemma D.1, Section D","source_id":"paper","statement":"**Lemma D.1.** For every $n\\ge0$ and fields $f,g$, $$\\begin{align}\n \\sum_i\\|\\partial_{a_i}f\\|_{[n],\\gamma}\n &\\le C\\ell_*^{-1}\\|f\\|_{[n+1],\\gamma},\\qquad\n \\|\\partial_sf\\|_{[n],\\gamma}\n \\le h^{-1}\\|f\\|_{[n+1],\\gamma}, \\tag{D.3}\\\\\n \\|fg\\|_{[n],\\gamma}\n &\\le C_n\\|f\\|_{[n]}\\|g\\|_{[n],\\gamma}. \\tag{D.4}\n\\end{align}$$ With $\\langle f\\rangle_s$ the phase average, $$\\begin{equation}\n \\|\\langle f\\rangle_s\\|_{[n],\\gamma}\\le\\|f\\|_{[n],\\gamma},\\qquad\n \\|f-\\langle f\\rangle_s\\|_{[n],\\gamma}\\le2\\|f\\|_{[n],\\gamma},\\qquad\n \\|\\partial_s^{-1}f\\|_{[n],\\gamma}\\le C\\|f\\|_{[n],\\gamma}\n \\quad(\\langle f\\rangle_s=0). \\tag{D.5}\n\\end{equation}$$ For phase-independent fields, (D.4) also holds with $\\|\\cdot\\|_{[n],1/2}$ in place of $\\|\\cdot\\|_{[n]}$ and $\\gamma\\equiv1$.","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/nodes/euler.lemma-d.1","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/nodes/euler.lemma-5.3","id":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/edges/%5B%22euler.lemma-5.3%22%2C%22euler.lemma-d.1%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/edges/%5B%22euler.lemma-5.3%22%2C%22euler.lemma-d.1%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semantic_class":"curated_argument_support","to":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/nodes/euler.lemma-d.1"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed7